  Round n=100:
    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ For each ad i:                               │
    │   avg   = clicks so far / times shown        │
    │   conf  = uncertainty (shown rarely = high)  │
    │   ucb   = avg + conf                         │
    │                                              │
    │ Pick ad with highest ucb                     │
    │ Show ad to user → get reward (0 or 1)        │
    │ Update N_selected, sum_rewards               │
    └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  ---
  9. Why UCB is Reinforcement Learning

  ┌──────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  RL Concept  │              UCB Equivalent               │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Agent        │ UCB algorithm                             │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Environment  │ Website users                             │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Action       │ Which ad to show                          │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ State        │ Current round n                           │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Reward       │ Click = +1, No click = 0                  │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Exploration  │ Show uncertain ads (high confidence term) │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Exploitation │ Show best known ad (high avg_reward)      │
  └──────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────┘

  ---
  10. How Confidence Shrinks Over Time

  Ad 5 shown 10x   → confidence = √(2×log(n)/10)  = large  → still exploring
  Ad 5 shown 100x  → confidence = √(2×log(n)/100) = medium → more confident
  Ad 5 shown 5000x → confidence = √(2×log(n)/5000)= tiny   → fully exploiting

  As Ad 5 keeps getting clicked, its avg_reward stays high and confidence shrinks — UCB keeps selecting it because it genuinely is the best ad.

